### URL: https://www-dev.springfield.moz.works/get/

# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = Unduhan { -brand-name-firefox } dari { $partner } tidak tersedia dalam bahasa Anda. Anda tetap dapat mengunduh { -brand-name-firefox } melalui tombol di bawah ini.

# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-device-not-available = Unduhan { -brand-name-firefox } dari { $partner } tidak tersedia untuk perangkat Anda. Anda tetap dapat mengunduh { -brand-name-firefox } melalui tombol di bawah ini.

# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-already-using-firefox = Anda sudah menggunakan { -brand-name-firefox }. Kunjungi firefox.com untuk mendapatkan informasi terbaru.

# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-continue = Lanjut ke firefox.com

# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
